Third-party runtime dependencies (installed via pip, each under its own license):

- psycopg / psycopg[binary] — PostgreSQL adapter for Python (LGPL-3.0)
- pgvector — pgvector support for Python (MIT-like / PostgreSQL License)
- neo4j (optional) — Neo4j Bolt driver for Python (Apache 2.0)
- faster-whisper (optional) — local speech-to-text (MIT)

